<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Shotgun</Major>
    <Description>The best timing macro shotgun in "Point Blank", can be used for all shotguns, easy to use with an accurately adjusted time to make your game more enjoyable.

macros built with fully guaranteed customization, error free, and easy to use</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 25 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 10 ms
GoWhile 7 2
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 ms
Delay 315 ms
IfKey 7 0 21
Goto 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>